node 6 Compositing Comment
  pos 0 722
  s text Shakuhachi Bamboo Breath Synth. End-blown bamboo flute model combining deterministic jet-edge breath noise, phase-modulated bore resonance, overblown octave chiff, and soft saturation.
  f width 340
  f height 120
end
